## Third-party components

### dsh-Go (https://github.com/ccch1mneyyy/dsh-Go)

The iOS engine integration (NodeMobile host, engine addons, optional iSH guest)
is built from dsh-Go's iOS branch, which is licensed under AGPL-3.0. This
repository was relicensed from MIT to AGPL-3.0 for that reason. The app's own
SwiftUI sources remain by 郑壹鸣 and are distributed under the same AGPL-3.0.

- Engine host / addons: `DshNodeHost.framework`, `DshFlock.framework`,
  `DshRequireBuiltin.framework`
- Optional Linux guest: `DshGuest.framework` (iSH upstream, GPL-family; its own
  upstream licence travels with the binary)

No dsh-Go source code is vendored here; the frameworks are produced by running
their published tooling (`tooling/ios/prepare-engine.sh`, `build-engine-native.sh`,
`embed-engine.sh`) against their repository at build time.

### Plugin market data

The plugin catalogue shown in-app comes from `ccch1mneyyy/dsh-go-market`
(published index at https://go.dshtui.com/market/index.json). Only metadata is
fetched and displayed; no plugin code is bundled, installed or executed by this
app.
